`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
**Penguin anatomy in voxels:** Think in 3 vertical zones — feet/legs (Y=0–5), torso ellipsoid (Y=6–21), head sphere (Y=22–31). The white belly should be pushed toward Z-front (lower Z) to show on the face side. Orange feet (color 7) and beak are key recognition cues.
`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`

